cription': 'Non-empty ordered conditions; combined left-to-right ((c1) conn2 c2) conn3\u2026 like Calc Standard Filter\u2014not arbitrary parentheses. First item: omit connection (ignored). From item 2: omit or AND (default) vs previous, or OR. Examples: [{\"field\":0,\"operator\":\"EQUAL\",\"value\":\"X\"},{\"field\":1,\"operator\":\"GREATER\",\"value\":\"10\",\"is_numeric\":true}]; [{\"field\":1,\"operator\":\"CONTAINS\",\"value\":\"a\"},{\"field\":3,\"operator\":\"CONTAINS\",\"value\":\"b\",\"connection\":\"OR\"}].', 'minItems': 1, 'nullable': False}}\n    Returns an output of type: object\n- clear_sheet_filter: Remove the active standard sheet filter on a range so all rows show again. Use the same range (and has_header) as apply_sheet_filter. delegate_to_specialized_calc_toolset(domain='sheets').\n    Takes inputs: {'range': {'type': 'array', 'items': {'type': 'string'}, 'description': 'Same data range used when applying the filter (e.g. [\"A1:D20\"]).', 'nullable': False}, 'has_header': {'type': 'boolean', 'description': 'Should match apply_sheet_filter (default true).', 'nullable': True}}\n    Returns an output of type: object\n- get_sheet_filter: Return active filter criteria and has_header for a range, or empty if none. delegate_to_specialized_calc_toolset(domain='sheets').\n    Takes inputs: {'range': {'type': 'array', 'items': {'type': 'string'}, 'description': 'Same range as apply_sheet_filter.', 'nullable': False}}\n    Returns an output of type: object\n- create_sheet: Creates a new empty sheet (tab exists; no cells copied). create_sheet is not Sample/deliverable populate \u2014 after create, write_formula_range with source to copy a block onto the new sheet.\n    Takes inputs: {'sheet': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'New sheet name', 'nullable': False}, 'position': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Sheet position (0-based). Appended to end if not specified.', 'nullable': True}}\n    Returns an output of type: object\n- delete_sheet: Deletes an ex