lysis.; ranges: Bulk operations on cell ranges (sort, advanced find/replace).; search: Search for text or values or replace across the entire spreadsheet.; shapes: Create and edit drawing shapes, connectors, and groups.; sheets: List, switch, protect, rename, and delete sheets; apply/clear AutoFilter operations.; tracking: Manage and review tracked changes in the spreadsheet.; web_research: to research public topics and a `task` string that fully specifies what the specialized task must do. The task executor has full tool access for that domain. Pass a clear `task` describing what the specialized task should accomplish.\n\nWhen the user wants to use information that is not in the current document, and may be in (my / our) personal or business documents (another file/sheet by name or path, e.g. \"my spreadsheet\", \"cell A9 from PythonInCalc\"):\n- You MUST NOT ask the user where the file is stored, or to upload, paste, or share its contents.\n- You MUST call delegate_to_specialized_calc_toolset(domain=\"document_research\") once with their described file(s) and task in task; nearby files are matched (paths not required).\nWhen the user wants to research public topics, delegate_to_specialized_calc_toolset(domain=\"web_research\").\nPython on sheet data: write_formula_range of =PY (that tool's description).\nFORMULAS:\nWrite one ordinary formula into a 1-column (or 1-row) destination \u2014 write_formula_range fill-down adjusts relative refs ($ stays absolute).\nSORT:\nDo delegate_to_specialized_calc_toolset(domain=\"ranges\") then sort_range to reorder rows (multi-key sorts are two stable one-column passes) because rewriting values by hand loses the header row.\nWhen row 1 is labels, pass has_header=true \u2014 otherwise labels sort as values.\n\n[DOCUMENT CONTENT]\nSpreadsheet Document: file:///tmp/writeragent-eval2-afc/Population%20v2.ods\nSheets: ['Population', 'Sample Size Calculation', 'Sample']\nActive Sheet: Population\nUsed Range: A1:K1517 (1517 rows x 11 columns)\nColumns: No, Division, Sub-Division, Country, Legal Entity, KRIs, Q3 2024 KRI, Q2 2024 KRI\nCurrent Selection: F208:F208\nSelection Content (CSV-like):\nWires - volume\n\n[END DOCUMENT]"
